OL,3,AKiller who escaped Tennessee prison
OL,4,Acaptured after week-long manhunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS authorities have recaptured a
OL,7,Fconvicted murderer who escaped a
OL,8,FTennessee prison more than a week ago.
OL,10,FJacob Allen Morley, 28, was serving a
OL,11,Flife sentence over the killing of his
OL,12,Fcolleague in 2022, when he escaped from
OL,13,Fthe Northwest Correctional Complex in
OL,14,FTiptonville, about 90 miles (145 km)
OL,15,Fnorth of Memphis.
OL,17,FThe Tennessee Department of Correction
OL,18,F(TDOC) said security footage showed
OL,19,FMorley, wearing his prison uniform,
OL,20,Fbreaching the prison fence around
OL,21,F11:30pm on 25 October, and later
OL,22,Fstealing a vehicle from a nearby farm.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
