OL,3,AKiller who escaped Tennessee prison
OL,4,Acaptured after week-long manhunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday the Tennessee Bureau of
OL,7,FInvestigation (TBI) announced Morley
OL,8,Fwas in custody after an operation that
OL,9,Finvolved local, state and federal
OL,10,Fagencies.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
